# qeq-fluctuating-charge perf twin: 1000 repeated qeq/point solves (dt=0)
units metal
atom_style charge
boundary f f f
region simbox block 0 40 0 40 0 40
create_box 3 simbox
create_atoms 1 single 20.0 20.0 20.0
create_atoms 2 single 20.0 20.0 21.205
create_atoms 3 single 20.943 20.0 19.412
create_atoms 3 single 19.057 20.0 19.412
mass 1 12.011
mass 2 15.999
mass 3 1.008
pair_style coul/cut 10.0
pair_coeff * *
neighbor 2.0 bin
fix q all qeq/point 1 10.0 1.0e-10 500 param.qeq
fix integ all nve
timestep 0.0
thermo 1000
run 1000
